# ScoutAnalytics_v3.2.0.pbix Placeholder

This file represents where your original Power BI file should be placed.

To use the final package:
1. Copy your existing ScoutAnalytics_v3.2.0.pbix file to this directory
2. Rename it to exactly: ScoutAnalytics_v3.2.0.pbix
3. Run: ./generate_pbix_connected.sh

The script will:
- Copy your original .pbix to ScoutAnalytics_v3.3.0.pbix
- Apply Scout Advisor theme
- Configure DAL connectivity
- Generate deployment instructions

Your original v3.2.0 file will remain unchanged.
